# Coding rules — zanzibaba-real-estate-v2

## Phase 0 (current)

- No `src/` or `package.json` yet — do not add pages until user approves build
- Edit only under this project folder
- New app code must be **written fresh**, not copied from `zanzibaba-real-estate`

## When Phase 1 starts

- TypeScript strict mode
- App Router under `src/app/`
- Portal route group: `src/app/(portal)/` for marketing landing
- Data: move `content/reference/*` → `src/data/` and fix paths
- Assets: sync `assets/` → `public/` for Next static serving
- Run `npm run build` before marking tasks complete

## Imports

- Use `@/` path alias for `src/`
- No cross-imports from sibling `active-projects/*`

## Env

- Secrets in `.env.local` only; document keys in `.env.example`
- Never commit `.env` or API keys

## Git

- Independent repo; do not merge with v1 history
- Commit only when user asks
